@startuml
actor Operator
participant Scheduler
participant "AEO-2 Session Manager" as Sessions
database State
Operator -> Scheduler: resume milestone
Scheduler -> State: load claims, leases, executions
Scheduler -> Sessions: reconcile process identities
alt still active or unverifiable process
Sessions --> Scheduler: retain ownership
Scheduler -> State: retain lease and block replay
else confirmed terminal result
Sessions --> Scheduler: persisted result
Scheduler -> State: reconcile evidence and release claim
else uncertain outcome
Sessions --> Scheduler: interrupted or unknown
Scheduler -> State: reconciliation_required, retain leases
end
Scheduler --> Operator: evidence and outstanding blockers
@enduml
